{"id":9606116770104,"title":"Robotic Cat Nybble Q Coding Robot Cat | Petoi","handle":"petoi-nybble-q-robot-cat","description":"\u003cdiv class=\"kai-product-desc\" style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNYBBLE Q - AT A GLANCE\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBest for:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003eAdvanced makers who want the most expressive open-source robot platform, researchers studying feline quadruped locomotion, developers building complex multi-DOF behavior systems, and educators who want a robot for robotics coding and physical AI learning.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhat it is:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e An open-source programmable four-legged robot cat, sold pre-assembled. It's the next generation of Nybble, Petoi's original platform (Indiegogo 2018, delivered 2019), with a 3D-printed body, an upgraded microcontroller, and feedback servos\u003c\/span\u003e. 11 servo joints for richer, more expressive movement patterns. Same OpenCat framework and full programming compatibility as Bittle X - Python API, Arduino IDE, Coding Blocks, ROS2.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eKey specs:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e11 servo joints (2 head + 1 tail + 8 legs) · BiBoard V1 (ESP32) · Built-in WiFi + Bluetooth + voice mic · Python API · Arduino IDE · Coding Blocks · ROS2 · Raspberry Pi compatible\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePrice:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Starting f\u003c\/span\u003erom $435 (pre-assembled) ·\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWarranty:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e1 year\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 class=\"kai-product-desc-center\"\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003eMeet Nybble Q\u003cbr\u003e– the Smart, Interactive, Adorable Open Source Robot Cat\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"kai-product-desc-center\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"data:image\/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAAAAACH5BAEKAAEALAAAAAABAAEAAAICTAEAOw==\" width=\"1024\" height=\"442\" data-src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0550\/2015\/9160\/files\/Meet_Nybble_Q_the_Smart_Interactive_Adorable_Open_Source_Robot_Cat_-_no_text_-_1046px_1024x1024.jpg?v=1764232435\" class=\"lazyload\" style=\"float: none; max-width: 100%; height: auto; aspect-ratio: 1024 \/ 442;\" alt=\"Meet Nybble Q, the Smart, Interactive, Adorable\nOpen Source Robot Cat.\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"embed-container\" itemscope itemtype=\"https:\/\/schema.org\/VideoObject\"\u003e\n\u003cmeta itemprop=\"name\" content=\"Meet Nybble Q: The 3D-Printed Coding Robot Cat with Voice Control, Touch Interaction \u0026amp; Sensor\"\u003e\n\u003cmeta itemprop=\"description\" content=\"Meet Nybble Q, the next-generation coding robot cat from Petoi. Nybble Q is a 3D-printed, ESP32\/Arduino-powered quadruped robot cat.\"\u003e\n\u003cmeta itemprop=\"thumbnailUrl\" content=\"https:\/\/img.youtube.com\/vi\/MTKV-3J2uZM\/maxresdefault.jpg\"\u003e\n\u003cmeta itemprop=\"uploadDate\" content=\"2026-01-29T21:22:57-08:00\"\u003e\n\u003cmeta itemprop=\"duration\" content=\"PT0M47S\"\u003e\n\u003cmeta itemprop=\"contentUrl\" content=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=MTKV-3J2uZM\"\u003e\n\u003cmeta itemprop=\"embedUrl\" content=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/MTKV-3J2uZM\"\u003e\n\u003ciframe title=\"Meet Nybble Q: The 3D-Printed Coding Robot Cat with Voice Control, Touch Interaction \u0026amp; Sensor\" data-src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/MTKV-3J2uZM\" class=\"lazyload\" allowfullscreen\u003e\u003c\/iframe\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003e📺 As featured on KTVU Fox 2 San Francisco — \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=UNP5bdrhWPE\" target=\"_blank\"\u003eWatch the segment →\u003c\/a\u003e\n\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003ch3 class=\"kai-product-desc_h3\"\u003e35+ Lifelike Behaviors via Mobile App Control or Voice Commands\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003ch4 class=\"kai-product-desc-center\"\u003e10 additional customized voice commands can be programmed in C++\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"kai-product-desc_p\"\u003e\u003cvideo style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 1024px; height: auto; aspect-ratio: 1024 \/ 576;\" data-src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/videos\/c\/o\/v\/7f23aef2c4cd40d3ba99d154b5749fa3.mp4\" class=\"video lazyload\" preload=\"none\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" controls=\"controls\" loop=\"loop\" autoplay=\"autoplay\" playsinline=\"\" muted=\"\"\u003e\u003c\/video\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"kai-product-desc-center\"\u003eNote: some prior coding experience in Scratch, C++ or Python is highly desirable. Kids under 10 can enjoy playing with and coding Nybble Q with adult supervision.\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003ch3 class=\"kai-product-desc_h3\"\u003eSmart Adorable Responses via Built-in Sensors\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"kai-product-desc_p\"\u003e\u003cvideo style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 1024px; height: auto; aspect-ratio: 1024 \/ 576;\" data-src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/videos\/c\/o\/v\/1e0b46237855475b8cd1d7010c9c8941.mp4\" class=\"video lazyload\" preload=\"none\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" controls=\"controls\" loop=\"loop\" autoplay=\"autoplay\" playsinline=\"\" muted=\"\"\u003e\u003c\/video\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 class=\"kai-product-desc_h3\"\u003e\n\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/guide.petoi.com\/apis\/serial-protocol\/feedback-servos\" target=\"_blank\"\u003eAdvanced Feedback Servos\u003c\/a\u003e Power Human-Guided Robotics Skill Creation\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"kai-product-desc_p\"\u003e\u003cvideo style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 1024px; height: auto; aspect-ratio: 1024 \/ 576;\" data-src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/videos\/c\/o\/v\/666bce7ad6f14ec3b516f524c47ae64f.mp4\" class=\"video lazyload\" preload=\"none\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" controls=\"controls\" loop=\"loop\" autoplay=\"autoplay\" playsinline=\"\" muted=\"\"\u003e\u003c\/video\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 class=\"kai-product-desc-center\"\u003eA Robot Cat That Teaches Robotics Coding and Entertains\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"kai-product-desc-center\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"data:image\/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAAAAACH5BAEKAAEALAAAAAABAAEAAAICTAEAOw==\" width=\"1024\" height=\"501\" data-src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0550\/2015\/9160\/files\/nybble_q_roboto_cat_coding_language_support_-_c_python_block_coding_1024px_1024x1024.jpg?v=1764230843\" class=\"lazyload\" style=\"float: none; max-width: 100%; height: auto; aspect-ratio: 1024 \/ 501;\" alt=\"Nybble Q robot cat coding language support: C++, Python and block coding\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch5 style=\"text-align: center;\" class=\"kai-product-desc-center\"\u003eFrom robotics coding education to robotics DIY projects, AI robotics applications or research, Nybble Q adapts to every skill level, supporting \u003ca href=\"\/pages\/resources-curriculum-stem-coding-robot\" target=\"_blank\"\u003eblock-based coding, Python \u0026amp; C++\u003c\/a\u003e.\u003c\/h5\u003e\n\u003ch3 class=\"kai-product-desc-center\"\u003eNo-code Robotics Skill Programming with \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/guide.petoi.com\/desktop-app\/skill-composer\" target=\"_blank\"\u003ePetoi Skill Composer\u003c\/a\u003e\n\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"kai-product-desc_p\"\u003e\u003cvideo style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 1024px; height: auto; aspect-ratio: 1024 \/ 576;\" data-src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/videos\/c\/o\/v\/6da34a983f934a0198d302404653c1f4.mp4\" class=\"video lazyload\" preload=\"none\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" controls=\"controls\" loop=\"loop\" autoplay=\"autoplay\" playsinline=\"\" muted=\"\"\u003e\u003c\/video\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\n\u003ca href=\"\/collections\/nybble-q-accessories\" target=\"_blank\"\u003eOptional Accessories\u003c\/a\u003e to Enhance Your Experiences\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"\/collections\/nybble-q-accessories\" target=\"_blank\"\u003e \u003cimg src=\"data:image\/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAAAAACH5BAEKAAEALAAAAAABAAEAAAICTAEAOw==\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; aspect-ratio: 1024 \/ 576;\" width=\"1024\" height=\"576\" data-src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0550\/2015\/9160\/files\/nybble_q_robot_cat_-_petoi_controller_stand_accessory_-_16x9_68c7558d-3878-439a-a1a5-4fb836f2cc60_1024x1024.jpg?v=1764222694\" alt=\"nybble q robot cat - petoi controller + coding stand accessory\" class=\"kai-product-desc-img lazyload\"\u003e \u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 class=\"kai-product-desc-center\"\u003eCustomize It with 3D-Printed Parts\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003ch5 style=\"text-align: center;\" class=\"kai-product-desc-center\"\u003eNybble Q's body is 3D-printed, and Petoi shares Nybble Q print files on \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/github.com\/PetoiCamp\/NonCodeFiles\/tree\/master\/stl\/NybbleQ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003eGitHub\u003c\/a\u003e, free for non-commercial use, so you can design and print your own parts. For ideas, see \u003ca href=\"\/blogs\/blog\/3d-printed-accessories-nybble-open-source-robot-cat\" target=\"_blank\"\u003e3D-printed accessories for Nybble and Nybble Q\u003c\/a\u003e.\u003c\/h5\u003e\n\u003ch3 class=\"kai-product-desc-center\"\u003eAdd a Brain: Raspberry Pi, Arduino Modules and On-Device AI\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"kai-product-desc-center custom-image-center\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"data:image\/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAAAAACH5BAEKAAEALAAAAAABAAEAAAICTAEAOw==\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; aspect-ratio: 1024 \/ 376;\" width=\"1024\" height=\"376\" data-src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0550\/2015\/9160\/files\/nybble_q_robotc_cat_raspberry_pi_integration_1024x1024.jpg?v=1764222953\" class=\"lazyload\" alt=\"Program Petoi Nybble Q Robot Cat with Raspberry Pi\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003csection style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 16px; justify-content: center; margin: 18px auto 8px; max-width: 1080px;\"\u003e\n\u003csection style=\"flex: 1 1 220px; max-width: 340px; border: 1px solid #e5e5e5; border-radius: 10px; padding: 16px 18px; text-align: left; background: #fff;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0 0 6px;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e🧠 More computing power\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0;\"\u003eAdd a Raspberry Pi for extra CPU, memory and sensor support, for tasks such as reinforcement learning and autonomous navigation.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/section\u003e\n\u003csection style=\"flex: 1 1 220px; max-width: 340px; border: 1px solid #e5e5e5; border-radius: 10px; padding: 16px 18px; text-align: left; background: #fff;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0 0 6px;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e💬 Talk to it with on-device AI\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0;\"\u003ePetoi's open-source \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/github.com\/PetoiCamp\/opencat-gemma\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003eopencat-gemma\u003c\/a\u003e runs Google's Gemma on a phone or laptop and turns your requests into Nybble Q's moves, with no cloud calls. At a Google Gemma hackathon, a team even ran it on an iPhone. \u003ca href=\"\/blogs\/blog\/gemma-on-device-physical-ai-robot-dog-hackathon\" target=\"_blank\"\u003eRead the story →\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/section\u003e\n\u003csection style=\"flex: 1 1 220px; max-width: 340px; border: 1px solid #e5e5e5; border-radius: 10px; padding: 16px 18px; text-align: left; background: #fff;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0 0 6px;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e🤖 Physical AI on a real robot cat\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0;\"\u003eSee what people build with physical AI on Petoi robots.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 10px 0 0;\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"\/pages\/quadruped-physical-ai\" target=\"_blank\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSee physical AI projects →\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/section\u003e\n\u003c\/section\u003e\n\n\u003ch3 class=\"kai-product-desc-center\"\u003e\n\u003ca href=\"\/pages\/opencat-open-source-robot-pet-framework\" target=\"_blank\"\u003eOpenCat Open Source Platform\u003c\/a\u003e for Advanced Users to Hack Their Own Quadrupeds\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"\/pages\/opencat-open-source-robot-pet-framework\" target=\"_blank\"\u003e \u003cimg src=\"data:image\/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAAAAACH5BAEKAAEALAAAAAABAAEAAAICTAEAOw==\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; aspect-ratio: 1024 \/ 573;\" width=\"1024\" height=\"573\" data-src=\"https:\/\/www.petoi.com\/cdn\/shop\/files\/opencat_intro_1024x1024.png?v=1670305427\" class=\"lazyload\" alt=\"Petoi open source robotics framework OpenCat overview\"\u003e \u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 class=\"kai-product-desc-center\"\u003eWhat's Included\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"data:image\/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAAAAACH5BAEKAAEALAAAAAABAAEAAAICTAEAOw==\" width=\"1024\" height=\"768\" data-src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0550\/2015\/9160\/files\/nybble_q_robot_cat_package_content_picture_1024x1024.jpg?v=1747458079\" class=\"lazyload\" style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 100%; height: auto; aspect-ratio: 1024 \/ 768;\" alt=\"Nybble Q package contents: the pre-assembled robot cat, an extra servo, a USB cable, a screwdriver and small spare parts\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul style=\"text-align: left; display: inline-block; margin: 8px auto 0;\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNybble Q robot cat, pre-assembled, with its Li-ion battery (7.4V 1000mAh)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUSB Type-C to USB cable for wired connection and charging (charger not included)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAn extra servo\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eA screwdriver and small spare parts\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n","published_at":"2025-11-26T21:3